{"id": "DehO64bvSkV", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get these 5 Claude Code plugins to code like a senior dev.\n\nIf you want your Claude Code to code like a real senior dev, you need to install these 5 free plugins.\n\nFirst is Agent Skills.\n\nIt's a pack of 24 skills built by a former director at Google.\n\nIt covers your entire dev cycle.\n\nAnd it activates the right skill at each stage of coding, all on its own.\n\nSecond is Context7.\n\nIt gives Claude the latest docs for whatever libraries and tools you're using.\n\nSo it never codes against outdated versions again.\n\nThird is Graphify.\n\nIt turns your entire codebase into a knowledge graph.\n\nIt links every file and function together.\n\nSo Claude doesn't need to re-read everything again and again.\n\nFourth is 21st MCP.\n\nIt gives Claude access to over 10,000 professional UI components.\n\nYou can add them straight into your project with one command.\n\nFifth is Strix.\n\nIt attacks your vibe coded app like a real hacker.\n\nIt finds and fixes any security vulnerabilities left behind.\n\nTogether, these five cover the biggest gaps in most Claude Code setups.\n\nThink of it like giving your Claude a full senior engineering team.\n\nEach one fixes a different weak spot.\n\n#vibecoding #aicoding #claudecode #aiplugins #agentskills", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792076610, "like_count": 4212, "comment_count": 4099, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-3335461096656333a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.962, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPMxEtZAWfb5P_sxlSBgQc6pVmurHHZKM_opiFEnsRVZRwxSEmQUwbDtWXYjZDQNmjvdxa6XWTpTP0yshJNqArnPyvfXVc5E-Z6gbs.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdrTKS3MuBPLZ5ICS1uWU63s2raslaoDDHdx72HEy52nFpQ6NAwtYI